<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">- 1 BATESALONIKA Tonga Translation Project</book>
  <para style="h">1 BaTesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lugwalo Lutaanzi LwaPawulu kuBaTesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 BaTesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Tes</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lugwalo Lutaanzi LwaPawulu Ku</para>
  <para style="mt1">BATESALONIKA</para>
  <para style="imt">Manjililo</para>
  <para style="ip">Lugwalo lutaanzi kubaTesalonika lwakalembwa aMutumwa Pawulu (1 BaTesalonika 1:1). Ngalulaba lugwalo lutaanzi Pawulu ndwaakalemba oolo lwakaba chipanzi chaBbayibbili alimwi lwakalembwa muminyaka ilimakumi musanu amunyaka umwi kaali Kkirisitu wazyalwa. Pawulu wakali muKkorinte naakalemba lugwalo oolu kumbungano yakuTesalonika, imbungano njakatalika kali mulweendo lwakwe lwachibili lwakukambawuka (Inchito 17:1-10). Lyamba kuti mubbuku lyaInchito imbungano yakali yakidwe abaJuda bache abaGirikki bayiingi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pawulu taakakonzya pe kukkala muTesalonika kwachiindi chilamfu kaali watalika mbungano, aboobo wakatumizya lugwalo oolu muchiindi chakayinda kasungwaazya basyomi nkuko. Lugwalo oolu lujisi mitwe yamakani myiingi amalayilile mayingi atala abanaKkirisitu mbubeelede kupona. Pawulu ulangisisya loko atala akuboola kwachibili kwaKkirisitu. Ambweni basyomi bakumbungano yakuTesalonika bakali achiyandisyo kapati amutwe wamakani ooyu. Pawulu wakabelesya kuboola kwaKkirisitu kwachibili mbuli kubasungwazya kuti bapone buumi bubotezya Leza (1 BaTesalonika 5:6-8).</para>
  <para style="iot">Bwiime</para>
  <para style="io1">Pawulu utalika lugwalo oolu akujuzya mbungano akulumba Leza ankaambo kabo (1 BaTesalonika 1:1-10)</para>
  <para style="io1">Mpawo upandulula atala anchito zyakwe amakani Timoti ngakamweetela (1 BaTesalonika 2:1—3:13)</para>
  <para style="io1">Chitobela Pawulu upa malayilile kubanaKkirisitu kuti beelede kupona mumumuni wakuboola kwachibili kwaJesu (1 BaTesalonika 4:1—5:15)</para>
  <para style="io1">Pawulu umanisya akujuzya mbungano lubo akubakumbila kuti babe achoonzyo kuti muntu woonse mumbungano abale lugwalo oolo (1 BaTesalonika 5:16-28)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1" />Ime Pawulu, aamwi aSilivanasi aTimoti,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 1:1">Kubasyomi bali mumbungano yakuTesalonika muli Leza Taata aMwami Jesu Kkirisitu:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 1:1">Luzyalo lwaLeza aluumuno lube kulindinywe.<verse eid="1TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Buumi Alusyomo LwaBaTesalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2" />Tupa kulumba kuli Leza lyoonse ankaambo kanu moonse, tatuleki pe kumwaambilizya moonse kuli Leza munkombyo zyesu, <verse eid="1TH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3" />tulamuyeeya kunembo lyaLeza wesu aTaata atala amilimu yanu yalusyomo akubeleka kwanu kwaluyando akukakatila kwabulangilizi muMwami wesu Jesu Kkirisitu. <verse eid="1TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4" />Bakwesu nimuyandwa aLeza, tulizi kuti wakamusala, <verse eid="1TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5" />nkaambo nitwakaza amakani mabotu kulindinywe, peepe amajwi luzutu, pesi alubo amunguzu amuMuuya Usalala akusyoma kuzwide. Mulizi mbutwakapona akati kanu nkaambo kanu. <verse eid="1TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6" />Alimwi mwakaba basikutuyiiya akuyiiya Mwami, nikuba kuti mwakapenzegwa kapati, mwakatambula ijwi eeli alukondo oolo luzwa kuMuuya Usalala; <verse eid="1TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7" />aboobo mwakaba chitondeezyo kubasyomi boonse bali muMasedoniya amuAkkaya. <verse eid="1TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8" />Nkaambo ijwi lyaMwami teelyakeendelela kuzwa kulindinywe mumasena akuMasedoniya akuAkkaya luzutu pe, pesi lusyomo lwanu muli Leza lwakeendelela koonse. Aboobo tatucheelede kwaambila muntu pe atala anchicho. <verse eid="1TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9" />Nkaambo lwabo balaamba kuti mwakatutambula biyeni akati kanu, ambumwakachenguluka kuzwa kumizimu akukutawukila Leza wachoonzyo alimwi upona, <verse eid="1TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10" />akulindila Mwana Mulombe wakwe kuzwa kujulu, ooyo ngwaakabusya kuzwa kubafu, Jesu ooyo utuvuna kubukali bwaLeza oobo buchiza.<verse eid="1TH 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2" />
  <para style="s">Milimu YaPawulu MuTesalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1" />Bakwesu, nkaambo inywe lwanu mulizi, kuti kumuswaya kwesu kulindinywe teekwakali kwabiyo pe. <verse eid="1TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2" />Pesi nikuba boobo twakali twapenzegwa kale alimwi akufwisigwa bweeme kuFilipi, mbuli mbumuzi, twakaba abusichaamba muli Leza wesu kuti tukambawuke makani mabotu aLeza kulindinywe mukwiinda mukulwanisigwa kupati. <verse eid="1TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3" />Nkaambo kukombelezya kwesu takuzwi kumiyeeyo italuleme pe nikuba kuchita chitaluleme alimwi tatuliikweezya kweneena kufumbwa muntu pe. <verse eid="1TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4" />Kwiinda boobo, lyoonse twambuula mbuli bantu bakazumininwa aLeza akusyomegwa amakani mabotu, aboobo tatukambawuki kuti tubotezye bantu pe, pesi Leza, ooyo usunka myoyo yesu. <verse eid="1TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5" />Mulizi loko kuti teetwakaza amajwi akumubotezya pe, nikuba teetwakasama chisamo chabusindya pe kukumweeneena, chabusindya pe, Leza ngukamboni wesu. <verse eid="1TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6" />Teetwakali kuyanduula kulumbayizigwa kuzwa kubantu pe, nikuba kuzwa kulindinywe nikuba kuli bamwi, <verse eid="1TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7" />nikuba kuti twakaleelede kusesa mbuli batumwa baKkirisitu. Pesi twakali bombya akati kanu, mbuli mwanakazi unyonsya bana bakwe. <verse eid="1TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8" />Nkaambo kaluyando lwesu ndutwakali aalo kulindinywe twakali libambilide kuti twaabane andinywe peepe makani mabotu luzutu azwa kuli Leza pesi alubo abuumi bwesu. Mwakali bayandisi loko kulindiswe. <verse eid="1TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9" />Bakwesu, choonzyo mulayeeya mbutwakabeleka kapati akuminwa sikati amansiku, kuti tutabi angutulemezya, nitwakali kumukambawukila makani mabotu aLeza.<verse eid="1TH 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10" />Muli bakamboni besu, aLeza alubo, twakali basalali biyeni abaluleme abatakwe kampenda mukupona kwesu akati kanu nibasyomi; <verse eid="1TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11" />nkaambo mulizi biyeni, mbuli wisi abana bakwe, <verse eid="1TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12" />twakasungwazya umwi awumwi wanu alimwi twakamuumbulizya akumulayilila kuti mupone buumi bweelela Leza, umwiita mubwami abulemu bwakwe.<verse eid="1TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13" />Alimwi tulumba Leza lyoonse aswebo nkaambo kacheechi, kuti nimwakatambula ijwi lyaLeza ndimwakamvwa kulindiswe, mwakalizumina peepe mbuli ijwi lyabantu pesi mbuli mbulibede, ijwi lyaLeza, libeleka mulindinywe nibasyomi. <verse eid="1TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14" />Nibakwesu, nkaambo kanu, mwakaba bayiyi bambungano zyaLeza muli Kkirisitu Jesu zili muJudiya, nkaambo mwakapenzegwa zintu zyeelene kuzwa kubantu bakulindinywe mbuli mbubakachita kuzwa kubaJuda, <verse eid="1TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15" />bakajeya aamwi Mwami Jesu abasinsimi, akutwaanda, akunyemya Leza akukazya bantu boonse <verse eid="1TH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16" />akutukasya kukambawuka kuli batazi Leza kuti bafutulwe, aboobo mbuli lyoonse kuti bazuzye mweelwe wazibi zyabo. Pesi bukali bwaLeza bwabasikila kumamanino!<verse eid="1TH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chiyandisyo ChaPawulu Chakubaswaya Lubo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17" />Nibakwesu, mbukunga twakali pambukene andinywe, kwakayindi kaniini, mubuntu peepe mumoyo, twakasungwaala kapati alimwi achiyandisyo chipati kuti tumubone busyu kubusyu; <verse eid="1TH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18" />nkaambo twakali kuyanda kuti tuze kuli ndinywe, ime, Pawulu, lubo alubo, pesi Satani wakatukasya. <verse eid="1TH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19" />Nkaambo mbuuli bulangilizi bwesu nikuba lukondo nikuba musini wakulikankayizya kunembo lyaMwami wesu Jesu kukuboola kwakwe? Tamweesi ndinywe na? <verse eid="1TH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20" />Nkaambo choonzyo muli bulemu alukondo lwesu.<verse eid="1TH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1" />Nkikaako nitwakakachilwa mumapenzi, twakazumina kuchaala atuliikke kuAteni, <verse eid="1TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2" />alimwi twakatuma mukwesu Timoti, asimulimuma waLeza mumakani mabotu aKkirisitu, kuti azomusimye akumusungwazya mulusyomo lwanu, <verse eid="1TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3" />kuti kutabi naba umwi usunzulusigwa amapenzi aaya. Inywe lwanu mulizi kuti twakasalilwa nzizyo. <verse eid="1TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4" />Nkaambo nitwakali andinywe, twakamwaambila kale kuti tweelede kupenzegwa; mbuli mbuzyakachitika, alimwi mbuli mbumuzi. <verse eid="1TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5" />Nkaambo kacheechi, nindakakachilwa mumapenzi, ndakatuma umwi kuti ndizibe lusyomo lwanu, nkaambo ndakayoowa kuti ambweni sikusunka wamusunka alimwi kuti kubeleka kwesu kuyooba kwabiyo.<verse eid="1TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6" />Pesi lino kuti Timoti waboola kulindiswe kazwa kulindinywe, alimwi watweetela makani mabotu alusyomo lwanu aluyando alimwi watwaambila kuti mulatuyeeya lyoonse chabuuya achiyandisyo chakutubona, mbuli mbutuli achiyandisyo chakumubona, <verse eid="1TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7" />Nibakwesu, nkaambo kacheechi, , mukuusa kwesu koonse akupenzegwa twakawumbuluzigwa atala andinywe mukwiinda mulusyomo lwanu, <verse eid="1TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8" />nkaambo lino tulapona, naa mwayimikila nji muMwami. <verse eid="1TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9" />Nkaambo nkulumbaanzi nkutunga tulapa kuli Leza nkaambo kanu, nkaambo kalukondo loonse ndutimvwa atala andinywe kunembo lyaLeza wesu? <verse eid="1TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10" />Tulakomba chakumaninina sikati amansiku kuti tukabonane busyu kubusyu akumwaabila eecho nchimubula mulusyomo lwanu.<verse eid="1TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11" />Lino Leza wesu aTaata lwakwe, aMwami wesu Jesu, batubambile nzila yesu kulindinywe. <verse eid="1TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12" />Alimwi Mwami achite luyando lwanu kuti luyungizigwe akufwasuka kuli umwi awumwi akubantu boonse, mbuli mbutuchita kulindinywe, <verse eid="1TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13" />kuchitila kuti ayake myoyo yanu akubula kampenda mubusalali kunembo lyaLeza wesu aTaata, kukuboola kwaMwami wesu Jesu abasalali bakwe boonse.<verse eid="1TH 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4" />
  <para style="s">Buumi Oobo Bubotezya Leza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1" />Nibakwesu, kumamanino, tulamukumbila akumusungwazya muMwami Jesu, kuti mbuli mbumwakayiiya kulindiswe mbumweelede kupona akubotezya Leza, mbuli mbumuliikuchita kale, ngamuchite mbuboobo lyoonse. <verse eid="1TH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2" />Nkaambo mulaazi malayilile ngitwakamupa mukwiinda munguzu zyaMwami Jesu. <verse eid="1TH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3" />Nkaambo ooku nkuyanda kwaLeza, kusalazigwa kwanu, kuti mulikasye kumalalane, <verse eid="1TH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4" />kuti umwi awumwi wanu azibe mbwayelede kuzyotolola mubili wakwe mubusalali abulemu, <verse eid="1TH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5" />peepe muzisusi zyamubili mbuli batakombi batazi Leza; <verse eid="1TH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6" />kuti kutabi muntu ubisya, akujanina munyina mweenya munkani eeyi, nkaambo Mwami nguupa chisubulo muzintu eezi zyoonse, mbuli mbutwaka muchenjezya kale. <verse eid="1TH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7" />Nkaambo Leza teewakatwiitila busofwazi pe, pesi kupona mubusalali. <verse eid="1TH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8" />Nkikaako kufumbwa ukaka malayilile aaya, takakili muntu pesi ukakila Leza, ooyo upa Muuya Usalala wakwe kulinduwe.<verse eid="1TH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9" />Lino atala aluyando lwabunyina taakwe cheelelo chakuti umwi amulembele, nkaambo inywe lwanu mwakayiisigwa aLeza kuyandana, <verse eid="1TH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10" />alimwi nichoonzyo mulabayanda boonse bakwesu muMasedoniya yoonse. Nibakwesu, tulamusungwazya, kuti muchite oobo chakwiindilila, <verse eid="1TH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11" />kuti muyandisye kupona chuumunizi, mudunamine azyanu, akubeleka amaboko aanu, mbuli mbutwakamulayilila <verse eid="1TH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12" />kuchitila kuti mupone buumi bululeme kuli baabo balikunze, alimwi mutabi mukuli kuli bamwi.<verse eid="1TH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuboola KwaMwami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13" />Bakwesu, tatuyandi kuti mubule luzibo, atala abaabo balede, kuti mutawusi mbuli bamwi mbubachita aabo batakwe bulangilizi. <verse eid="1TH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14" />Nkaambo mbukunga tulasyoma kuti Jesu wakafwa akubuka lubo, nikuba boobo, mukwiinda muli Jesu, Leza uyoomweeta antoomwe abaabo bakafwa mulinguwe.<verse eid="1TH 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15" />Nkaambo eechi tulachaamba kulindinywe ajwi lyaMwami, kuti iswe nitubawumi, bacheede mane kukuboola kwaMwami, tatukwe kuyootalika pe kuli aabo bafwide. <verse eid="1TH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16" />Nkaambo Mwami lwakwe uyooseluka kuzwa kujulu akoompolola kwakulayilila, akwiita kwamupati wabaangelo, amundindimina wamweembo waLeza. Alimwi bafwide muli Kkirisitu bayootalika kubuka. <verse eid="1TH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17" />Eelyo iswe nitubawumi, nitucheede, tuyoobwezegwa aamwi ambabo mumayoba kuti tukaswaanane aMwami mumulengalenga; alimwi aboobo tuyooba aMwami kwalyoonse. <verse eid="1TH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18" />Nkikaako amuumbulizyane amajwi aaya.<verse eid="1TH 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5" />
  <para style="s">Ngamulibambile Kuboola KwaMwami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1" />Nibakwesu, mbuli kuchiindi akuzyiindi, takukwe nchimweelede kulembelwa pe. <verse eid="1TH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2" />Nkaambo inywe lwanu mulizi kabotu kuti buzuba bwaMwami buyoosika mbuli mubbi mansiku. <verse eid="1TH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TH 1:9">2 Tes 1:9</ref>.</char></note> Bantu nibayooti, “Kuli luumuno akukwabililwa,” eelyo mpawaawo lunyonyooko luyooza alimbabo mbuli kumyongwa mbukuza kumwanakazi waamba kutumbuka, alimwi takukwe kuyooba kuchija pe, <verse eid="1TH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4" />nibakwesu, pesi inywe tamuli mumudima pe, nkaambo buzuba oobo tabukwe kuyoomugambya pe mbuli mubbi, <verse eid="1TH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5" />Nkaambo inywe moonse mulibana bamumuni abana basikati. Tatuli bana bamansiku nikuba bamumudima pe. <verse eid="1TH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6" />Aboobo eelyo tutawoni, mbuli bamwi mbubachita, pesi atusinsimuke alimwi akulibatamika. <verse eid="1TH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7" />Nkaambo aabo bantu boona, boona mansiku, abaabo bantu bakolwa, bakolwa mansiku. <verse eid="1TH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8" />Pesi, mbutuli basikati, ngatulibatamike, alimwi tusame lusyomo aluyando mbuli chikwabilizyo chakaango, abulangilizi bwalufutuko mbuli ngwaani yalubulo. <verse eid="1TH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9" />Nkaambo Leza teewakatusalila bukali pe, pesi kuti tujane lufutuko mukwiinda muMwami wesu Jesu Kkirisitu, <verse eid="1TH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10" />ooyo wakatufwida kuchitila kuti nikuba katuchili bawumi nikuba katufwide kuti tukapone anguwe. <verse eid="1TH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11" />Nkikaako amusungwazye umwi awumwi akuyakana, mbuli mbumuliikuchita kale.<verse eid="1TH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malayilile Akumamanino Akujuzyana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12" />Nibakwesu, tulamukumbila, kuti mulemeke aabo babeleka akati kanu alimwi bamuzulida muMwami abamuyiisya, <verse eid="1TH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13" />alimwi mubalemeke akubayanda kapati muluyando nkaambo kamulimu wabo. Akube luumuno akati kanu.<verse eid="1TH 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14" />Nibakwesu, tulamusungwazya, kuti mubachenjezye bakandu, musungwazye bayoofu, mugwasye bakompeme, mube amoyo mulamfu kubantu boonse. <verse eid="1TH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15" />Amulange kuti kutabi umwi wanu ubweedezya chibi kuchibi, pesi choonse chiindi muyanduule kuchita kabotu kuli umwi awumwi akuli boonse.<verse eid="1TH 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16" />Amukondwe lyoonse, <verse eid="1TH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17" />amukombe lyoonse, <verse eid="1TH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18" />mupe kulumba muzintu zyoonse; nkaambo eechi nkukuyanda kwaLeza kuli ndinywe muli Kkirisitu Jesu.<verse eid="1TH 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19" />Mutakasyi Muuya, <verse eid="1TH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20" />mutasampawuli businsimi, <verse eid="1TH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21" />pesi musunke zintu zyoonse; mujatisisye eecho chibotu, <verse eid="1TH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22" />mulikasye kububi bwamusyobo woonse.<verse eid="1TH 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23" />Leza waluumuno lwakwe amusalazye chakumaninina; alimwi muuya wanu amoyo amubili ubambwe kabotu akubula kampenda kukuboola kwaMwami wesu Jesu Kkirisitu. <verse eid="1TH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24" />Ooyo umwiita ulisyomekede, alimwi uyoochichita.<verse eid="1TH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25" />Nibakwesu, amutukombele.<verse eid="1TH 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26" />Amujuzye bakwesu boonse akujuzyana kusalala.<verse eid="1TH 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27" />Ndamulayilila muMwami kuti lugwalo oolu lukabalwe kubakwesu boonse.<verse eid="1TH 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28" />Luzyalo lwaMwami wesu Jesu Kkirisitu lube andinywe.<verse eid="1TH 5:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5" />
</usx>